  "observed_review": [
    "Three independent specialty analyses selected adaptive audio over public-task recalibration, unavailable licensed Windows delivery and repeated persistence/visual studies. Coordinated C# host/composer, source assay and Web Audio work; primary integrated actual PCM controls and continuity. No human listening attribution.",
    "Actual AudioContext postmix PCM is captured by an instrument-only zero-output ScriptProcessor branch. Simultaneous pre-gain stem capture tests shared100/150Hz harmonic phase; actual37ms path delay is detected. This is digital graph observation, not physical audio latency.",
    "Mute produces measured zero PCM. Maximum UI-gain rapid commands preserve bounded voices/headroom. Excess master gain is detected as over-range float samples. A real audio.js duplicate-guard mutant replays accepted audio and fails the sequence criterion.",
    "Terminal cues stop old threat voices. Restart clears cue/backlog and keeps both transport clocks aligned but silent; explicit suspend/resume recreates both at one start. Blur during resource decoding invalidates the pending enable.",
    "Optional preserved producer reproduces16 WAVs exactly and retains two differing compressed Vorbis byte identities; original compressed media are never rewritten. No encoding-cause or listening-equivalence claim."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Canonical source comparison binds source identities, PCM measures and actual control classifications. Every execution enforces mixer thresholds; variable mixer samples are retained separately instead of claiming bit-exact scheduling.",
    "Browser PCM windows and phase measurements vary across scheduling/sample rates. Captured preview concatenates declared real output windows, not one continuous performance or a production master.",
    "Procedural source composition and semantic/signal correctness are distinct from human cue recognition, masking, musical quality, comfort, accessibility, exclusive rights or commercial clearance.",
    "No hardware speakers/headphones, physical latency, final musical/class/world canon, Unity import/Editor, Windows player, Steam, durable audio preferences or production networking validation."
  ]
